      "text": "Strumento che attrae i Pokémon. È utile per fuggire\ndalla lotta con Pokémon selvatici.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A toy that attracts the attention of a Pokémon.\nIt guarantees escape from any battle with\nwild Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンの　気をひかせる　道具。\n野生ポケモンとの　戦闘から\n絶対に　逃げられる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能吸引宝可梦注意的道具。\n在和野生宝可梦的\n战斗中绝对可以逃走。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un objeto que atrae a los Pokémon. Es útil para huir de\nun combate contra un Pokémon salvaje.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
